From 5dc06567b7c206274deeb14b2765b65da4889bee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Farhan <farhanabdm@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 07:09:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gi): sealed modes, talent effects and party-only buffs

Custom character buffs and talent effects can now express Anastasya's kit:
- Buffs can target the other party members only ("others").
- A toggle can have several options (e.g. Accolades: no one Sealed /
  others Sealed / Anastasya Sealed); buffs and effects pick an option,
  and the choice is shared by every card using that toggle.
- Talent effects change talent values instead of stats: a DMG multiplier
  on values matched by name ("deals 125% of its original DMG"), or an
  extra hit copying matched values ("250% of its original DMG") with stat
  bonuses for that hit only.

Anastasya's preset now follows how her kit divides Accolades when
someone is Sealed (A1/C1/C4), adds C2 Honor's 125% multiplier and C6's
extra Triumph and Doom hits, and uses one Blessing toggle (Love/Honor).

The editor shows buffs and talent effects as one-line summaries opened
one at a time; rendering all of them open took over 30 seconds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
